 style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">profile_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">jurisdiction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">scheme</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">entity_ref</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">stage_code</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">activity_value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">factor_value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> kg_co2e,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">source_tier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> disclosure_profile p</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> activity_record a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">stage_code</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ANY (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">boundary_stages</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> emission_factor f </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">factor_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">factor_ref</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">period_start</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">effective_from</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sunset_on</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> OR</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">period_end</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sunset_on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这套结构解决的核心问题是<strong>版本爆炸</strong>：当 CBAM 的计算规则在 2026 年更新、ESRS 的适用日期被推迟、PPWR 在 2026 年 8 月适用，你不需要改数据管道，只需要新增或修改 <code>disclosure_profile</code> 的行。所有历史申报的可复算性由 <code>profile_id + version</code> 保证——审计时能精确复现&quot;当时是按哪版规则出的数&quot;。</p>\n<p>有一点必须诚实对待：<strong>不要用一个 profile 覆盖多个法域</strong>。即使看起来相似（例如欧盟 CBAM 与英国 CBAM），边界与算法也可能不同，强行复用会在其中一个法域出错，而错误只在申报被驳回时才暴露。宁可多几行配置，每个法域一行。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>所有碳披露要求都能用四个维度定位：谁要、什么口径、什么粒度、何时生效。</li>\n<li>四类要求全都汇入同一套活动数据层，差别只在边界裁剪、粒度与计算规则上。</li>\n<li>三处冲突：边界不同（CBAM 只到生产段）、分摊规则不同、核验深度不同；规则必须与输出绑定。</li>\n<li>用活动数据层加可版本化 <code>disclosure_profile</code> 的架构，把应对新规的成本从&quot;改管道&quot;降到&quot;加配置行&quot;。</li>\n<li>不要用一份配置覆盖多个法域，即使它们看起来相似。</li>\n<li>数字交付出去之后的下一步是让它变小，见 <a href=\"../../emission-reduce-offset/fulfillment-decarbon-lever\">履约减排杠杆</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"各市场碳披露规则矩阵","id":"各市场碳披露规则矩阵"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"主要法域要求的对照矩阵","id":"主要法域要求的对照矩阵"},{"level":2,"text":"需求差异的三类冲突","id":"需求差异的三类冲突"},{"level":3,"text":"边界、分摊、核验深度","id":"边界-分摊-核验深度"},{"level":2,"text":"实现：一套数据源多口径输出","id":"实现-一套数据源多口径输出"},{"level":3,"text":"活动数据层与报告规则分离","id":"活动数据层与报告规则分离"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"CBAM 等碳数据申报要求","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-logistics-carbon-footprint/carbon-label-disclosure/cbam-carbon-data-report"},"next":{"title":"履约减排杠杆（模式/路由/包材）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-logistics-carbon-footprint/emission-reduce-offset/fulfillment-decarbon-lever"}}